# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private keys. Never commit an age identity to the repository that it
# decrypts. These patterns are a safety net, not a substitute for keeping
# your identity outside the repo (e.g. ~/.config/fjord/identity.txt).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
identity.txt
identity*.txt
*.identity
*.agekey
age-key*.txt
key.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Fjord state. The search index and caches are derived data — they can
# always be rebuilt from the files, and they must not be synced.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.fjord/cache/
.fjord/index/
.fjord/local/

# Partial writes.
*.age.tmp
*.tmp
*.part

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
.#*
\#*#
.vscode/
.idea/
